# Ignore EVERYTHING, re-include known-safe content, hard-deny secrets LAST.
# Vendored scripts MUST end in .sh/.py or they are blocked by the '*' rule.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!settings.json
!*.md
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.yaml
!*.yml
# --- hard-deny (MUST remain last) ---
**/.credentials.json
**/.claude.json
**/*.local.json
